      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a middle school social studies teacher and i'm trying to prep a unit on social movements. can u help me draft a lesson plan that helps my students understand why certain perspectives are seen as progressive and revolutionary, and why others are seen as regressive and stubborn? i want them to see the difference in how these groups approach change.",
