      "content": "that's a good start but i think it might be a bit too abstract for 12 year olds. they need more concrete examples. can you give me a breakdown of a specific historical movement using those categories? like, could you show me how to frame a movement that was revolutionary vs one that was just being regressive so they can see the contrast clearly?",
