    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. can you give me another example where the 'regressive' side has a logic to it? i want to make sure i'm not just teaching them that 'regressive' means 'bad'. like, is there a way to explain the arguments of people who resist change so it doesn't sound like they're just being stubborn for no reason?",
